  ```rust
  /// custom scope resolver — lexical chains: module > class > function
  pub fn bind(modules: Vec<ParsedModule>, root: &Path) -> Result<IrFragment, AdapterError>
  // resolution:
  //   absolute imports against the package root; relative imports (`from . import x`)
  //   against the importing module's package; `__init__.py` marks package containers
  //   (and acts as the folder barrel — its re-exports are emitted as-is)
  // edge emission:
  //   import / from-import        -> value-import (hard)
  //   annotations (params, returns, variables) -> type-reference (soft)
  //   class bases                 -> inheritance (hard)
  //   resolvable calls            -> call (hard)
  //   getattr / importlib / star import via __all__ -> confidence < 1.0
  // polarity:
  //   test_*.py, *_test.py, tests/ -> TestCase
  //   conftest.py + test-only helpers -> TestSupport
  ```
--{ ref: bb530514-db34-4120-aad4-35ee63c69f5c }--

